Thus issue: keydown handler prevented default and stopped propagation, then computed nextActiveElement via getNextActiveElement, then called Tab.getOrCreateInstance(nextActiveElement).show(). However maybe the show() method does not focus the tab? In Bootstrap tabs, showing a tab should also set focus? Let's look at tab.js code.

